    <string name="settings_lookup_title">Cloud spam and caller ID</string>
    <string name="settings_lookup_body">When on, a call from a number that isn\'t in your contacts is looked up in the cloud for its spam status and, if known, the caller\'s name. Numbers in your contacts are never sent.</string>
    <string name="settings_face_down_title">Ring silently when face down</string>
    <string name="settings_face_down_body">A call that arrives while the phone lies face down rings without sound and keeps the screen on.</string>
    <string name="settings_overlay_title">Show over other apps</string>
    <string name="settings_overlay_body">During a call, buttons to go back to it, switch the speaker or hang up show over other apps.</string>
    <string name="settings_pill_title">Call pill</string>
    <string name="settings_pill_rings_title">Incoming calls ring in the pill</string>
    <string name="settings_pill_rings_body">While you\'re using the phone, a call that comes in rings in the pill instead of a pop-up. WhatsApp calls ring in the pill too, but WhatsApp\'s own notification can\'t be hidden.</string>
